# This repo

# This repo

Vanilla GitHub Pages site. Root `/` is a Hello placeholder. Game hub is `/links/`. Table tennis lives at `/table-tennis/` (`table-tennis/` JS/CSS; reuses `js/signaling.js`, `js/guest.js`, `js/starGameHost.js`). Other apps (`/lobby/`, `/fodinha/`, `/presidente/`, `/count/`, `/game-of-life/`) keep their own paths and are linked from `/links/`. Host browser is authoritative. Firebase RTDB is signaling only (rooms, SDP, ICE). Game/lobby state goes over WebRTC data channels (star: guests to host).

Handoff docs are **local only** under `docs/` (gitignored). There is no root `AGENTS.md`. Before coding, read:

- `docs/AGENTS.md`
- `docs/ARCHITECTURE.md`
- `docs/DECISIONS.md`
- `docs/ROADMAP.md`
- `docs/SETUP.md`

Do not: put game state in Firebase; add a bundler/game engine without an ADR; commit `js/config.js`, `docs/`, or service accounts; mesh WebRTC; run a Node game server as the default path.

Extend `lobbyState` and `{ type: "intent" }` / `{ type: "state" }` for new features. Update ADRs when reversing a decision. Keep public `README.md` player-facing only.
